300	 * Legacy one-click wallet deploy, SUPERSEDED by `payAndDeployGame` + the
301	 * GameDeployWizard. Kept as a thin, wallet-only wrapper over the audited core so any
302	 * remaining caller keeps working: it charges the tier's DB-fed term price from the
303	 * wallet (full price — game has no first-month-free) and never opens a card leg.
304	 */
