807	 * Install the per-account Adminer database manager (or return the existing one).
808	 * Owner-or-admin + not-impersonating (same discipline as every resource-creating
809	 * action). Queues an INSTALL_DBTOOL task that drops Adminer into THIS account's
810	 * webroot at a randomized path served by the account's own FPM socket. The
811	 * customer logs in with their own SCOPED DB user, so a leaked path grants no
812	 * cross-tenant access (see the worker handler's SECURITY note). Idempotent: if the
813	 * tool is already installed, returns its path without re-queuing.
